#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG9677 expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "THE ALL-FACET GATE, PINNED AT THE MINT (D-17, 2026-09-13). This rule's Check is empty(ARM) and a populated ARMCD, so on a DM without the ARM column every ARMCD-populated row would fire (absent = all-missing). Requirements.Variables.All [ARMCD, ARM] rejects the dataset instead - the same pin the whole CDISC-CG0521/FDA/PMDA class carries (D-16, the absent-column verdict register (internal, not shipped)). If this scenario EXECUTES, the gate has been removed: escalate, do not rewrite the pin."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ARMCD type=Char label="Planned Arm Code"
---
S1 | DM | 001 | B
